@startuml
[*] --> RECORDED
RECORDED --> PENDING_CONFIRMATION : persist payment + audit
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> RECONCILED : authorized allocation confirmed
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> DISPUTED : dispute recorded
PENDING_CONFIRMATION --> VOIDED : audited void
DISPUTED --> RECONCILED : resolved and confirmed
DISPUTED --> VOIDED : resolution voids payment
RECONCILED --> [*]
VOIDED --> [*]
note right of PENDING_CONFIRMATION
  Payment remains in history;
  effective balance unchanged.
end note
note right of RECONCILED
  Apply confirmed allocations;
  effective balance changes atomically.
end note
@enduml
